Welcome to Multi-Talk 1.0
=========================

MTalk  1.0  is  a  complete  rewrite  version  from version .93.  Many
features  are  added to provide you with a better conferencing system.
You  may have noticed this version is somewhat different from previous
versions.   The decision was made to sacrifice compatibility for major
improvements.   You  are  encouraged  to  read  the online help to get
yourself  familar with the new system.  If you have any problems, such
as  issues related to compatibility, please consult your SysOp, or you
can  contact  me  directly  via  FIDONET:  1:153/765 or INTERNET/UUCP:
samy@sfu.ca.

    Regards,
        Sam Yee (11/14/93)
